The '''Bone Yard Hunter area''' is located slightly south-east of the [[Bone Yard]] in the [[Wilderness]]. Players with 67 [[Hunter]] can catch [[Black salamander (Hunter)|black salamander]]s here. Since this Hunter area is located in the Wilderness, an additional trap can be set in the area.

==Transportation==
*[[Burning amulet]] teleport to the Chaos Temple and run north-east from there.
*Teleport to the level 19 [[Wilderness Obelisk]].
*[[Carrallanger Teleport]] ([[Carrallanger teleport (tablet)|tablet]]) and run east from there.
*[[Games necklace]] teleport to the [[Corporeal Beast]] lair and run east.
*Enter the [[Wilderness]] from [[Varrock]] and run north-east.

==Hunter creatures==
The following [[Hunter]] creature is found in this area:

{|class="wikitable"
!Level
! colspan=2 |Creature
!Technique
|-
|67||{{plinkt|Black salamander (Hunter)|pic=Black salamander|txt=Black salamander}}||[[Net trap]]
|}

To trap black salamanders, use a [[small fishing net]] and [[rope]] on a [[young tree]]. [[Harralander tar]] may be used to bait the trap and a lit [[torch]] may be used on it to reduce the player's scent, slightly increasing chances of catching a salamander. Since this is the Wilderness as with the threat of [[player killers]], do '''NOT''' take items you cannot afford to lose.

==Monsters==
Players should be aware of [[player killer]]s when training in this hunter spot.

{{LocationMonsterTableHead}}
{{LocationMonsterTableLine|name=Hill Giant|levels=28|spawns=2}}
{{LocationMonsterTableBottom}}

==Personalities==
*[[Larran]] is located just west of this hunting spot, west of the lava crevice.

